    "excerpt": "<p>The Behavioural Science Blog is about high-quality and comprehensive articles written for those who want to follow the latest research, but find traditional sources inaccessible. Every who has got something to say about Behavioural Science is invited to join in and become an author. At the moment there are two author who have posted more [&hellip;]</p>\n",
